            "donation_img_3": "shopify://shop_images/hotMeals3.png",
            "donation_img_4": "shopify://shop_images/hotMeals4.png",
            "donation_banner_text": "<h2>Every Order Donates A <br/>Meal To Palestine</h2><p>With each purchase we provide a meal. Thank you for being part of this impact.</p><p><a>Learn how it works</a></p>",
            "donation_modal_text": "<h2>Every order donates a  meal to Palestine</h2><p>Since October 2023, we've committed to serving a freshly made meal in Palestine with every single order placed. To date, over <strong>360,000 meals</strong> have been donated, all thanks to you. This is made possible by the brave and selfless Pious Projects team who is on the ground in Gaza City as we speak, making meals amidst the genocide happening in Palestine. Thank you, Nominal Family, for being a part of something bigger.</p>"
          }
