          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Solid_Gold_Grp.jpg",
            "title": "Ethically Sourced Solid Gold",
            "info": "<p>By working directly with one single manufacturer, we are able to ensure the ethical sourcing of the solid gold we use across our Fine Jewelry Line. Each piece is crafted from Solid 18 Karat Gold, debossed with an 18K stamp, and arrives with a certificate of authenticity.</p>",
