    "c4aa895b-fdc2-4924-b8ce-d5ea5460b66f": {
      "type": "design_pack_-_faq_-_simple",
      "blocks": {
        "template--16177583947963__c4aa895b-fdc2-4924-b8ce-d5ea5460b66f-1684192050f18b8c41-0": {
          "type": "section_heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Customers ask..."
          }
        },
        "template--16177583947963__c4aa895b-fdc2-4924-b8ce-d5ea5460b66f-1684192050f18b8c41-1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where is the solid gold sourced?",
            "text": "<p>Our Solid 18 Karat Gold is ethically sourced from the heart of Amman, Jordan. We only work with one manufacturer to ensure direct responses and accountability.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--16177583947963__c4aa895b-fdc2-4924-b8ce-d5ea5460b66f-1684192050f18b8c41-2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is your return policy?",
            "text": "<p>It's simple -- if you don't like your solid gold piece for any reason, you have 30 days to send it back for a full refund. Period. In the US, we'll even pay for your return label.</p><p>Start your self-serve return right <a href=\"https://nominal.loopreturns.com/#/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://nominal.loopreturns.com/#/\" aria-label=\"link\">here</a> and we'll take care of the rest.</p><p>When the return window closes, please still never hesitate to reach out to us. Our goal is for you to always love and live in your piece.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--16177583947963__c4aa895b-fdc2-4924-b8ce-d5ea5460b66f-1684192050f18b8c41-3": {
          "type": "section_heading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Shipping"
          }
        },
        "template--16177583947963__c4aa895b-fdc2-4924-b8ce-d5ea5460b66f-1684192050f18b8c41-4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is there a warranty with my purchase?",
            "text": "<p>Absolutely. Our Fine Jewelry pieces all come with a two-year warranty which covers any manufacturing defects beyond typical wear and tear. While scratches, item loss, and breakage are not covered, please never hesitate to reach out to us so we can make things right.</p><p>Your solid gold piece will never tarnish or oxidize. While loss of shine might occur over the years due to normal wear from things such as the direct usage of lotions, perfumes, and other substances<em><strong>, </strong></em>this is not something that our warranty covers. We invite you to instead use warm water and a soft cloth to bring back that gorgeous shine back to life</p><p>In the rare instance that an item <em>arrives</em> with a defect such as scratches or any other issues, you have 10 days from the day of delivery to report it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--16177583947963__c4aa895b-fdc2-4924-b8ce-d5ea5460b66f-1684192050f18b8c41-5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How should I care for my solid gold piece?",
            "text": "<p>Because we use solid 18 karat gold across our Fine Jewelry line, you can wear your piece day in and day out, including in the shower, with never any worries about skin sensitivity or oxidization.</p><p>As a precious item, though, this piece deserves the utmost care. This includes avoiding direct application of perfume, lotion, or other household chemicals, removing it before entering chlorine-filled water, and cleaning it periodically.</p><p>When storing your solid gold piece, we recommend clasping it shut as if it's being worn, to avoid knots and tangles. </p><p>As a reminder, solid gold is not scratch-proof, so be mindful of how your pieces are treated during everyday wear and avoid wearing it during activities that could damage your pieces such as strenuous exercise or other heavy-duty tasks.</p><p>Dulling can rarely occur over time but your piece will never fade or tarnish; feel free to use a cloth and warm water on your piece to restore that beautiful shine.</p><p><em><strong>*Please note, while waterproof and sweatproof, that Qur'anic pieces should always be tucked away or removed prior to entering the restroom.*</strong></em></p>"
          }
        }
      },
